{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d755f378-e84d-5192-80ff-79ad86261c58",
    "name": "UndSurf — Rol Ayudante",
    "description": "Qué puede y qué no puede hacer el rol Ayudante, según la matriz de permisos (plan 15, sección 4) y RbacSeeder. Generada desde los permisos del seeder.\n\nUsa email_helper, password_helper y, opcional, hole_id del entorno (UndSurf-Production o UndSurf-Local). No crea ni modifica datos: las altas mandan un cuerpo vacío y esperan 422 (con permiso) o 403 (sin permiso).\n\nRequiere la API en 806e73c o posterior (/tenant/me/*) y el conector en línea para pozos, partes y riesgos.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01. Login Ayudante",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Código 200\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); });",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Retorna token\", function () { pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a(\"string\"); });",
              "if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"r_token\", json.token); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"r_user_id\", String(json.user && json.user.id)); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email_helper}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password_helper}}\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02. /auth/me: rol y permisos de la matriz",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Código 200\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); });",
              "const data = pm.response.json().data || {};",
              "const perms = (data.permissions || []).slice().sort();",
              "pm.test(\"role es helper\", function () { pm.expect(data.role).to.eql(\"helper\"); });",
              "const expected = [\"assignments.view\", \"dashboard.view_personal\", \"drill_holes.view_assigned\", \"mines.view\", \"observations.create\", \"observations.view\", \"projects.view\", \"risks.create\", \"risks.view\"];",
              "const extra = perms.filter(function (p) { return expected.indexOf(p) === -1; });",
              "const missing = expected.filter(function (p) { return perms.indexOf(p) === -1; });",
              "pm.test(\"Sin permisos de más (9 esperados)\", function () { pm.expect(extra, \"de más: \" + extra.join(\", \")).to.eql([]); });",
              "pm.test(\"Sin permisos de menos\", function () { pm.expect(missing, \"faltan: \" + missing.join(\", \")).to.eql([]); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{r_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "me"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "03. Mis asignaciones (200)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Código 200\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); });",
              "const list = ((pm.response.json().data || {}).assignments || []).map(function (a) { return String(a.hole_id); });",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"r_my_hole_ids\", JSON.stringify(list));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
